      "statement": "The Java A2aServer registers GET /v1/status (401 without an accepted token), GET /healthz and GET /readyz as Vert.x routes and provides StatusTracker as a @DefaultBean agents may replace; SkillExecutor.execute wraps each skill run in status.track().",
